  "id": "electronic-nose",
  "term": "electronic nose",
  "definition": "An electronic nose is a device that imitates how the mammalian sense of smell works by using multiple sensors, signal processing, and recognition algorithms to detect and identify odors. It is used to create odor patterns from complex smells for tasks such as rapid, noninvasive detection and monitoring.",
